## One-to-one SEO coaching and mentoring for founders

A founder or a single marketer can book any workshop as one-to-one training at the same price. The half day costs £750 and the full day costs £1,250.

One-to-one SEO training works on your own pages and your own Search Console data. The modules and the inclusions match the team workshops. You get tailored preparation, materials, exercise templates and a follow-up Q&A. I act as your SEO coach for the session. This is coaching in SEO. It is not marketing advice for coaching businesses.

SEO mentoring after a workshop is a separate service. Ongoing advice session by session is a separate consulting service. The comparison further down this page sets out the difference.

## Where does the training run?

SEO training UK-wide runs online or on site. Online sessions run live.

| Location | Delivery | Travel |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Anywhere in the UK | Online | None |
| Berkshire, Reading and the Thames Valley | On site or online | Added at cost |
| London | On site or online | Quoted with travel |
| Manchester and Birmingham | On site or online | Quoted with travel |
| Elsewhere in the UK | On site or online | Quoted with travel |

On-site SEO training in Berkshire and Reading adds travel at cost. SEO training in London, Manchester and Birmingham runs on site with travel quoted before you book.

Online and on-site sessions cover the same modules at the same price. On-site travel is the only difference in cost.

The online format brings SEO training near you to any UK office.

## What does SEO training cost?

SEO training costs £750 for a half-day workshop, £1,250 for a full day and £2,500 for the six-week programme. Each price covers a team of up to 8 people.

| Option | Live time | Included | Price |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
