## Do you offer an SEO certification or a free course?

No. There is no accredited certificate with this training.

People who want an SEO certification or a self-paced SEO training course have other routes. The Digital Marketing Institute (DMI) offers an SEO certification. The Data & Marketing Association (DMA) runs an SEO training course. Coursera lists online SEO courses. LocalIQ keeps a list of free online SEO courses.

Live training applies the method to your own site. Questions get answered during the session.

Broader digital marketing training covering paid ads and social media sits outside this page. My training covers SEO only.

My guide on [how to be an SEO](/blog/how-to-be-an-seo/) sets out the skills for a career in SEO.

## SEO training, consulting or done for you?

Training suits a team that will do the SEO work itself. Consulting suits a team that can do the work but wants senior advice on each decision. A retainer suits a business that lacks the time to do it in house.

| Option | What you get | Fits when |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Training | A shared method and exercises on your own site | The team will own the work |
| Consulting | Advice session by session | The team can act but wants a second opinion |
| Done for you | Strategy and execution handled for you | The team has no time to do the work |

Teams that want ongoing advice after training can book [SEO consulting](/services/seo-consulting/) session by session. The right choice depends on who will own implementation.

## SEO training FAQs

### Is the training generic?

No. It is built around your site. Every exercise uses your pages and your Search Console data.

### How many people can attend?

Up to 8 people attend at each fixed price.

### Can sessions be recorded?

Yes. Sessions can be recorded with the team's agreement. Attendees keep the materials and templates.

### Is this a Google SEO training course?

No. Google does not run or certify it. It does teach how Google Search crawls and indexes pages. It also covers how to read Google Search Console data.

### Does the training guarantee ranking changes?

No. I do not guarantee ranking changes from training.

### Is online training the same as on-site training?

Yes. The modules, the materials and the price are the same. On-site sessions add travel.

### How do I book SEO training?

Book the free 20-minute scoping call. Every engagement starts there.
